","charaName":"侍者维丝","text":"[show]原来如此，这些饮品……都是他留给我的啊。想在我到了能喝的年纪，一口气全送给我。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_27"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":50,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]维丝……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_28"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":50,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"侍者维丝","text":"[show]你们去的那个地方，是我爸爸的储藏室哦。[r]当然现在看来，地下还是他的酿窖。我和尼尔小时候经常在那边玩耍。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_29"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"侍者维丝","text":"[show]爸爸他……是一个名气很大的酿造师。[r]他对酿的痴迷，就和艺术家对艺术品的痴迷一样……一点也不亚于格薇勒哦。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_30"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"侍者维丝","text":"[show]也正因如此，他经常忙于工作而忽视了我。[r]那时候我甚至怀疑，他只把他酿出来的饮品当成自己的孩子。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_31"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"侍者维丝","text":"[show]再加上他是一个不怎么会说话的人，所以我和他的关系一直比较冷淡。[r]后来大兽潮来临……他和妈妈都遇害了。只留下了我一个人。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_32"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"侍者维丝","text":"[show]后来我再回到秘密基地，发现那里摆放着好几个木桶，也就是我现在手上的这种酿。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_33"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"侍者维丝","text":"[show]我当时想，这应该是大兽潮来临的时候，爸爸从某些地方抢救过来的吧，他到生命的最后……都没忘记他心爱的佳酿。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_34"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"n